    "_moved_2026_11_01": "BAY_L/R into the bay proper (were inside the dashboard volume and the wheel house), COWL_L/R into the plenum under the scuttle panel, engine-bay side (were inside the HVAC unit), DASH_L/R 18 cm rearward (were inside the 12 V battery / wheel house), KICK up 1 cm off the floor plate, APIL_L/R inward to the dash end panel (were inside the A-pillar), CPIL_L/R up 15 cm (were inside the wheel house), UFLOOR_L/R forward beside the rear drive unit (were in the wheel house / charger). Rule: a cell box may not enter a solid fixed block (battery, motor, seat, wheel house, aux unit); hollow volumes (dashboard, console) and pillars are allowed. BAY_L/R 8 cm further forward (y 1.45-1.75) after they touched the COWL boxes; cells keep >= 5 cm clearance from each other."
  },
